# A common global gitignore excludes a bare `tags` (ctags index files) at any depth, which also
# silently swallows this repo's own `/tags` route directories (`src/app/(app)/tags`,
# `src/app/api/tags` - the DogTag tag-management pages and API, unrelated to ctags). Re-include
# them explicitly; a parent-directory exclusion must be un-ignored before its contents can be.
!src/app/(app)/tags/
!src/app/(app)/tags/**
!src/app/api/tags/
!src/app/api/tags/**
# WP4.9: same ctags collision, for the new src/lib/tags/ (TagArtifact custody + export/import
# ceremony logic), src/components/tags/ (its shared UI - QR panels, target pickers), and
# tests/unit/tags/ (its unit tests) - none of these are route directories, but all three are still
# matched by the same bare `tags` global rule (confirmed via `git check-ignore -v`).
!src/lib/tags/
!src/lib/tags/**
!src/components/tags/
!src/components/tags/**
!tests/unit/tags/
!tests/unit/tags/**
